{"info": {"address1": "Plot No. W-44", "address2": "M.I.D.C. Phase II, Manpada Road Dombivli (East)", "city": "Thane", "zip": "421203", "country": "India", "phone": "91 70 45 59 27 03", "website": "https://indoaminesltd.com", "industry": "Chemicals", "industryKey": "chemicals", "industryDisp": "Chemicals", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Indo Amines Limited engages in the manufacture, distribution, and sale of fine, performance, and specialty chemicals in India and internationally. The company's fine chemicals comprise aliphatic and aromatic amines, aliphatic and aromatic nitriles, halides, alcohols, cycloalkanols, cycloalkanones, acids and esters, advanced intermediates, amine hydrochlorides, ethanol amines, and other products. Its specialty chemicals include fatty acids, amides, amines, di-amines, tertiary amines, polyamines, amine ethoxylates, and ammonium quats. The company's performance chemicals comprise anticaking, antifoaming, antistatic, antistripping, antibacterial/antislime, and floatation agents, as well as granulating aids, defoamers, emulsifiers, curing aids, bitumen emulsifiers, corrosion inhibitors, demulsifiers, and antibacterial products. Its products are used in pharmaceuticals, agrochemicals, fertilizers, petrochemicals, perfumery chemicals, road construction, pesticides, dyes and intermediates, water treatment chemicals, oil field chemicals, mining, paints, pigments, polymers, metal working and lubricants, additives, textile processing chemicals, cosmetics, home and personal care, printing inks, rubber chemicals, surfactants, etc. The company was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Thane, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 599, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vijay Bhalchandra Palkar B.Sc., B.Tech.", "age": 71, "title": "MD, CEO & Director", "yearBorn": 1954, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 15075000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"max